  "item_short_desc": "<p>Know a kid who loves the great outdoors or military-styled apparel? Designed with highly detailed camouflage patterns, our Kids Long Sleeve Camo T-Shirts are a staple for young explorers and outdoorsmen. These crewneck t-shirts are great for hunting, fishing, camping, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "11665",
  "description": "<p>Know a kid who loves the great outdoors or military-styled apparel? Designed with highly detailed camouflage patterns, our Kids Long Sleeve Camo T-Shirts are a staple for young explorers and outdoorsmen. These crewneck t-shirts are great for hunting, fishing, camping, everyday wear, and more. Rugged and Long-Lasting: The durable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend easily withstands vigorous outdoor use. The reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem further enhance the camo shirt&rsquo;s durability, and with a tag-less neck label, your child is free to move around without any itches or scratches. Great for Layering: The long sleeve t-shirt is perfect for either wearing on its own or as a base layer undershirt. It fits comfortably underneath vests, jackets, and coats. Built for the Great Outdoors: These camo t-shirts are standard fit, giving your young adventurer room and flexibility for various activities. Our shirts sit approximately at the waist for full coverage. The ribbed knit neck collar and wrist cuffs allow for a close fit without restricting movement. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete the look with a matching pair of our Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants for kids, or layer up with a Kids Camo Pullover Hooded Sweatshirt or a Kids M-65 Field Jacket. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over seven decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
